{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id562038833?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"user_852"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-24T09:33:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.13.0"}, "id":{"label":"13992474224"}, "title":{"label":"Functional but needs polish"}, "content":{"label":"Pros:\n•\tIn-app chat is genuinely useful\n•\tCredit card fee waiver in-app is a great touch\n•\tSC Pay with credit card is a standout feature — please never remove this\n\nCons:\n•\tFirst login experience is rough — one typo locks you out immediately, forced hotline call just to get started\n•\tPromotions dominate the home screen and bury important functions\n•\tSC Pay (轉數快) only supports phone/email/HKID as proxy IDs — 轉數快識別碼 not supported, which is limiting\n\nOverall: SCB clearly wants your business and the core functions work well. Fix the onboarding and FPS limitations and this becomes a top-tier banking app👍🏻", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
