{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id371953329?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"damienksc"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-26T04:15:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.12.0"}, "id":{"label":"13888568052"}, "title":{"label":"Constant Spam and Selling your Data"}, "content":{"label":"Unfortunately SCB has a a very unethical way of using its app in that if you enable push notifications (which kind of is essential for transaction etc) it will also push marketing spam. It’s a recent development. It’s totally outrageous the app spams out advertising every 2 hours! \n\nYou can’t choose the type of push notifications - just either yes or no and if you yes - you agree for your data to be sold and shared to everyone. \n\nIt’s sooo totally against even Hong Kong regulations - I’m not sure how they even did this?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
