{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id154289843?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"긱트"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-03T10:51:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.12.0"}, "id":{"label":"13810295219"}, "title":{"label":"Always with some bugs in basic banking functions"}, "content":{"label":"I am extremely frustrated with the continuous issues I am facing with this banking app. \n\n1. Time Deposits: I am unable to make time deposits, which is a core functionality I rely on.\n   \n2. Billing Issues: The app does not automatically show the correct credit card statement amount when I try to pay my bills.\n\n3. Login Problems: Most recently, I am unable to log in due to a \"key authentication unsuccessful\" error, even though I was able to log in just an hour ago.\n\nThese ongoing issues are unacceptable and reflect a serious lack of functionality and reliability. I am also growing increasingly concerned about the overall security of my financial information within the app. I urge the team to address these problems immediately.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
